":"font-display text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[0.02em] text-white mb-5","children":"How to Do SATS: A Complete Step-by-Step Guide for Beginners"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT text-lg leading-relaxed","children":"You don't need an hour of meditation or a special environment. SATS takes 10 minutes, happens every night you sleep, and is the most direct method for subconscious reprogramming ever discovered."}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 px-6 md:px-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":[["$","h2","0",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Prerequisites: What You Actually Need"}],["$","ul","1",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A bed (or any comfortable place to lie down)"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"10 minutes before sleep"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A chosen scene (one moment that implies your wish fulfilled)"}]]}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["That's it. No crystals. No special music. No expensive courses. SATS is free, available every night, and requires nothing but your own consciousness."]}],["$","h2","3",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 1: Choose Your Scene (Do This Before Bed)"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is the most important step, and it happens *before* you lie down."]}],["$","p","5",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Choose a single brief scene — one moment in time that implies your desire has already manifested. The scene should be:"]}],["$","ul","6",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Specific.** Not \"I am successful\" but \"I am holding my first book with my name on the cover.\""}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Implied.** The scene should imply the fulfilled desire, not show you getting it. Not the moment of receiving, but a moment *after*."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**First-person.** You are in the scene, not watching it."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Emotionally resonant.** When you mentally step into the scene, you should feel something shift in your body."}]]}]]}],["$","ul","7",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Someone congratulating you on your promotion"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Looking at your bank balance and feeling the quiet satisfaction of abundance"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Waking up next to the person you love"}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Unlocking the door of your new home"}]]}]]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Keep the same scene for at least 30 days. Consistency is more powerful than variety."]}],["$","h2","9",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 2: Enter the Hypnagogic State"}],["$","p","10",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Lie down in your usual sleep position. Close your eyes."]}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Begin a slow body scan: start at your feet and consciously release each muscle group upward. Feet. Calves. Thighs. Hips. Stomach. Chest. Shoulders. Arms. Hands. Neck. Face."]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["You're not meditating — you're cooperating with the body's natural relaxation response. Don't force anything. This usually takes 3-5 minutes."]}],["$","ul","13",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Your thoughts begin to drift and feel less controlled"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"You start to see brief, fleeting images (hypnagogic imagery)"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Your body feels heavy or distant"}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Time starts to feel slippery"}]]}]]}],["$","h2","14",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 3: Enter the Scene"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Once you feel the shift into the hypnagogic state, gently bring your chosen scene to mind."]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Don't force it with effort. Invite it like a familiar memory. You've practiced this scene enough times that it should arrive easily."]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Step into the scene from the inside. Feel the ground under your feet if you're standing. Feel the texture of whatever you're touching. Hear any sounds. Notice the emotional tone — that settled, satisfied quality of the wish fulfilled."]}],["$","h2","18",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 4: Loop Gently"}],["$","p","19",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Don't play the scene once and wait. Loop it — gently, without urgency — like a song you love playing on repeat."]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The scene should be short enough to loop naturally. 15-30 seconds is ideal. If your scene is too long, you'll find yourself analyzing it rather than feeling it."]}],["$","p","21",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Each time through, lean into the feeling more than the imagery. The feeling is the instruction. The imagery is just the delivery mechanism."]}],["$","h2","22",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step 5: Fall Asleep in the Scene"}],["$","p","23",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Your goal is to fall asleep while still in the scene — or as close to it as possible. The last conscious impression you carry into sleep is the most deeply planted."]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["If your mind wanders (and it will), gently return to the scene without frustration. Wandering is not failure. It is the nature of the hypnagogic state."]}],["$","h2","25",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Troubleshooting"}],["$","p","26",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"I fall asleep before I can even start the scene.\""}],"\nDo SATS earlier — right when you lie down, before you're too drowsy. Or try a brief SATS session in the early morning, when you wake but aren't fully alert."]}],["$","p","27",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"My mind keeps analyzing whether it's working.\""}],"\nThis is the critical factor still active. It means you're not yet in the hypnagogic state. Go back to Step 2 and spend more time on the body relaxation."]}],["$","p","28",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"I can't visualize clearly.\""}],"\nClarity of imagery is not required. What matters is the feeling. Some people do SATS with virtually no imagery and excellent results. Lean entirely into the emotional tone."]}],["$","p","29",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"\"How long before I see results?\""}],"\nThis varies. Some people see results within days. Others within 30-90 days. Remember the echo delay — current reality is a projection of past consciousness. Be patient with the bridge."]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"px-6 md:px-14 pb-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-black-2 border-2 border-orange-DEFAULT p-8 md:p-12 text-center","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":20,"height":20,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-crown text-orange-DEFAULT mx-auto mb-4","children":[["$","path","1vdc57",{"d":"M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.734H5.81a1 1 0 0 1-.957-.734L2.02 6.02a.5.